    "A one-hop trace: it goes to this repeater and back, and says how well each end heard the other." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trasování na jeden hop: jde k tomuto repeateru a zpět a ukáže, jak dobře se oba konce slyšely."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace na jeden hop: idzie do tego repeatera i z powrotem i mówi, jak dobrze każda strona słyszała drugą."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A screenshot of a code works too, for example one someone sent you." : {
      "localizations" : {
