    "Nothing heard straight from it since %@, while %lld packets arrived (about %lld would usually be its own). Your messages may not get through." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Od %@ od něj nebylo nic slyšeno přímo, i když mezitím dorazily pakety (%lld; obvykle by asi %lld z nich bylo jeho vlastních). Vaše zprávy možná neprojdou."
